\">\n                            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Duis bibendum diam eu tellus cursus, sodales sollicitudin erat pulvinar. Quisque in mauris blandit, cursus ipsum non, hendrerit enim. Nullam fringilla ex sed maximus efficitur. Sed auctor justo elit, ac vestibulum metus semper non.</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButton\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Create\n                                your own site</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{textWidth-1}}\">\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-class=\"{'last': steps == 1}\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span class=\"step-number mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">🍁</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-box\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardText\">\n                        <h4 class=\"icon-title card-title mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Saw Palmetto</b></h4>\n                        <h5 class=\"icon-text mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".icon-text\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\">Saw Palmetto is one of the most well-known ingredients for prostate support. It has been traditionally used to help maintain normal prostate size and support healthy urinary flow. Saw Palmetto works by supporting hormonal balance and helping reduce pressure on the bladder, making it especially beneficial for men experiencing frequent urination.</h5>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item mbr-flex\" mbr-if=\"steps > 1\